#chapter-opener(4, "If I Can't Speak for Myself",
  [Some day you may be unable to say what you want. This section tells the people who love you who speaks for you and what matters to you. Write it in plain words.])

#box(width: 100%, stroke: 1pt + black, inset: 10pt)[
  *Please note:* these pages are not a legal document. They do not replace a health care power of attorney or an advance directive.
]

#elp-heading[The Person Who Speaks for Me]
#elp-field[Name]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Relationship]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Phone]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2)[Have They Said Yes? Where Is That Written?]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Backup Person: Name]
#elp-gap
#elp-field[Backup Person: Phone]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[Where My Legal Papers Are]
The papers themselves are listed in Where My Important Papers Are. Write here only where to find them.
#v(0.1in)
#elp-table(("Document", "Where It Is Kept", "Who Has a Copy", "Date"),
  rows: 3, row-h: 0.6in, widths: (2.0in, 2.0in, 1.9in, 1.1in))
#v(0.1in)
Use the rows for: health care power of attorney, advance directive, living will.
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2)[Papers I Have Not Done Yet or Want to Update]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2)[The Lawyer or Office That Helped Me]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[What Matters to Me in My Care]
#elp-field(lines: 3, hint: [(quiet, music, light, touch, favorite things nearby)])[What Would Help Me Feel Comfortable]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 3, hint: [(at home, near family, a place I know)])[Where I Would Most Like to Be]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 3, hint: [(who, how often, who I would rather not see)])[Visitors]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[What Gives Me Strength]
#elp-field(lines: 3, hint: [(prayer, a pastor, rabbi, or imam, readings, traditions)])[My Faith or Beliefs]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 3)[Who I Would Like Nearby]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 3, hint: [(you may leave this blank)])[What Frightens Me]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 3)[Anything Else I Want Said Out Loud for Me]

#pagebreak()

#elp-heading[Organ Donation]
#elp-field(lines: 1, hint: [(Yes, No, or Still Deciding)])[My Answer]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2, hint: [(driver's license, a donor registry, a card)])[Where It Is Registered]
#elp-gap
#elp-field(lines: 2)[Anything I Want My Family to Know About This]

#elp-heading[Home or Facility]
#elp-field(lines: 3, hint: [(home, a family member's home, a care facility, not sure)])[Where I Would Prefer to Be Cared For]
